        <h2><span class="entryprev"><a href="https://thebaseballchronicle.com/personal_stories/the_hold_of_the_table" title="Previous story">&#8592;</a></span> <a href="https://thebaseballchronicle.com/essays/">Essays</a>, April 2009 <span class="entrynext"><a href="https://thebaseballchronicle.com/personal_stories/hooked_on_wrigley" title="Next story">&#8594;</a></span</h2>
